OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GMahler's haunting Ruckert Lieder
OL,6,     Gwith Latvian mezzo-soprano Elina
OL,7,     GGaranca feature in this concert
OL,8,     Gfrom Switzerland, alongside
OL,9,     GMahler's Tenth Symphony and
OL,10,     GBoulez's Memoriale.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,16,     GJoin Sarah Walker for three hours
OL,17,     Gof classical music to reflect,
OL,18,     Grestore and refresh, including a
OL,19,     Gcalming Choral Reflection at
OL,20,     G9.45, and another specially
OL,21,     Gchosen Sunday Sequence.
