OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,5,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,6,     Gstage and screen actor Paul
OL,7,     GChahidi, whose musical passions
OL,8,     Ginclude Beethoven, Vaughan
OL,9,     GWilliams, Persian folk music and
OL,10,     GSondheim.
OL,11,G1330FMusic Map
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch charts a course
OL,13,     Gto The Young Person's Guide to
OL,14,     Gthe Orchestra by Britten,
OL,15,     Gfeaturing composers inspired by
OL,16,     Gthe past, or exploring different
OL,17,     Gsections of an orchestra.
OL,18,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,19,     GLive from St Paul's Cathedral,
OL,20,     Gwith music by Judith Bingham,
OL,21,     GWalmisley, Wood and Parry.
