OL,4,G1945FSunday Feature: New Generation
OL,5,     FThinkers shorts
OL,6,     GHistorian, singer and New
OL,7,     GGeneration Thinker Ellie Chan
OL,8,     Gvisits Hardwick Hall in
OL,9,     GDerbyshire, in search of a
OL,10,     Gfascinating relic of Tudor
OL,11,     Gmusical culture.
OL,12,G2000FBach Cantata No 147
OL,13,     GThe Building a Library
OL,14,     Grecommended recording from
OL,15,     Gyesterday's Record Review.
OL,16,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,17,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,18,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,19,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,20,     Gweek, Kate explores the world of
OL,21,     Gthe pioneering Egyptian composer
OL,22,     GHalim El-Dabh.
